  "bio": "Nestled in the heart of Red Lion, Ali Bi Tattoo Studio stands as a haven for ink aficionados, offering masterful work in illustrative, floral, and lettering styles. Renowned for their precision and artistry, this boutique parlor at 90 W. Market St., Hallam, PA, ensures every client's vision becomes a permanent masterpiece. To book your session at this premier tattoo and body piercing destination, eschew the direct messages and reach out at alibitattoo@hotmail.com or call (717) 893-7767.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Red Lion, Pennsylvania, United States\n\nTattoos,Piercings & Laser removal \n90 w.market st.Hallam,Pa.17406       (717)893-7767                  \nNo DMs. Please email\nalibitattoo@hotmail.com",
